   "value": "n = 2\nu[k_] := Apply[Plus, Table[m[j] (1 - (x[k] - x[j]) Sign[k - j]), {j, 1, n}]]\nux[k_] := Apply[Plus, Table[-m[j] Sign[k - j], {j, 1, n}]]\n\nA=Table[m[i]m[j](-1 + x[i] - x[j]), {i,n}, {j,n}];\nA=Table[m[i]m[j](1 - (x[i] - x[j])Sign[i-j]), {i,n}, {j,n}];\nA//MatrixForm\n\nconst=kMinors[A,2];\nSimplify[Expand[const]]\nSimplify[Expand[dot[const]]]",
