  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "n = 4\nu[k_] := Apply[Plus, Table[m[j] Sin[(x[k] - x[j]) Sign[k - j]], {j, 1, n}]]\nux[k_] := Apply[Plus, Table[m[j] Sign[k - j] Cos[x[j] - x[k]], {j, 1, n}]]\n\nA=Table[m[i]m[j]Sin[(x[i] - x[j]) Sign[i - j]], {i,n}, {j,n}];\nA//MatrixForm\n\nconst=kMinors[A,1];\nSimplify[Expand[const]]\nSimplify[Expand[dot[const]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
