  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Print[\"Arctan(|x|)\"]\ncheck[ArcTan[#] &, 3]\nn = 3\nu[k_] := Apply[Plus, Table[m[j] ArcTan[(x[k] - x[j]) Sign[k - j]], {j, 1, n}]]\nux[k_] := Apply[Plus, Table[m[j] Sign[k - j] (1/(1 + (x[k] - x[j])^2)), {j, 1, n}]]\n\nA=Table[m[i]m[j]ArcTan[(x[i] - x[j]) Sign[i - j]], {i,n}, {j,n}];\nA//MatrixForm\n\nconst=kMinors[A,3];\nSimplify[Expand[const]]\nFullSimplify[Expand[dot[const]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<pre>Arctan(|x|)\n</pre>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "\"Arctan(|x|)\\n\"",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
